{"resourceIdentifier":"1351","resourceName":"Planting for the Future: Financially sustainable agroforestry systems and payments for ecosystem services","description":"Our project creates a scalable model for sustainable agriculture, which will reduce deforestation and which will be adopted at a landscape scale in the Peruvian Amazon. Farmers’ technical and business capacity will be enhanced, they will gain access to formal markets for native fruit and timber, and their incomes will be increased and diversified. As a result, the livelihoods of farming families will be enhanced and poverty reduced.  The project design is applicable to landowning smallholder farmers across Peru who have in the past relied on ‘slash and burn’ shifting cultivation agriculture or ranching that resulted in unproductive agricultural lands and degraded pastures.  The project will provide seedlings and training to farmers to reforest their farms, converting them from low productivity migratory agriculture where they have to rotate farmed areas to  market-orientated agroforestry systems.  The first project instances are located in Loreto and Ucayali Provinces of Peru.","location":{"latitude":-3.915035,"longitude":-73.344864},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1351"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Peruvian Amazon"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Plant your Future"},{"type":"string","value":"E.Sussex, United Kingdom"},{"type":"string","value":"+44 (0)7828 608711"},{"type":"string","value":"jennyhenman@plantyourfuture.org.uk"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"719"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry 